    <item>
      <title>免费hao 中行敦煌实物礼品</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2309328</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2309328</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 05:06:54 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;需要有中行卡才可以，&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;打开中国银行app点击首页，往下滑有一个热门活动，有一个博物东方·敦煌千彩的答题活动&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/5/b/a/5ba18f2b193e186a3119acfe7ee964429e58990b.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/d4BAvLSwlqr5wwcbO1PWGw3ibMv.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;1e6ca3497370979d2b2e54127e75231f&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/b/a/5ba18f2b193e186a3119acfe7ee964429e58990b_2_231x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;1e6ca3497370979d2b2e54127e75231f&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;d4BAvLSwlqr5wwcbO1PWGw3ibMv&quot; width=&quot;231&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/b/a/5ba18f2b193e186a3119acfe7ee964429e58990b_2_231x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/b/a/5ba18f2b193e186a3119acfe7ee964429e58990b_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/b/a/5ba18f2b193e186a3119acfe7ee964429e58990b_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;EEE6DF&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;里面有2个活动，&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;一个是答题抽奖，我反正5次机会都没过，问ai，找了好几个ai问，都没有答对，各位佬也可以试试。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/a/b/eaba1b3f84e6331d1846587316eb2bca56ec17cb.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/xuustvy8RK3UAxj0xcRH6vm5w83.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;图片&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/a/b/eaba1b3f84e6331d1846587316eb2bca56ec17cb_2_234x499.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;图片&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;xuustvy8RK3UAxj0xcRH6vm5w83&quot; width=&quot;234&quot; height=&quot;499&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/a/b/eaba1b3f84e6331d1846587316eb2bca56ec17cb_2_234x499.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/a/b/eaba1b3f84e6331d1846587316eb2bca56ec17cb_2_351x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/a/b/eaba1b3f84e6331d1846587316eb2bca56ec17cb_2_468x998.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;B9834C&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;第二个是最简单，就是完任务，中行卡有钱，然后用微信/支付宝 余额宝（提现没有手续费）的功能充到微信每次搞188+ 他给你一次抽奖机会，反正就是攒抽奖机会，每天9:00准时抽奖。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/4/b/14bdf7cfb2b9785d504cfa351740aa9dd7ac2d6c.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/2XuylzDxSf99XBxj0Jye4PPnk8k.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;211d95823782addd61afa9c1a68f4766&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/4/b/14bdf7cfb2b9785d504cfa351740aa9dd7ac2d6c_2_231x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;211d95823782addd61afa9c1a68f4766&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;2XuylzDxSf99XBxj0Jye4PPnk8k&quot; width=&quot;231&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/4/b/14bdf7cfb2b9785d504cfa351740aa9dd7ac2d6c_2_231x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/4/b/14bdf7cfb2b9785d504cfa351740aa9dd7ac2d6c_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/4/b/14bdf7cfb2b9785d504cfa351740aa9dd7ac2d6c_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;ECD8C5&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;不用攒那么多次数，只能中奖一次，我攒了50次，就用了10几次就中了，给了一个鼠标垫/手链啥的，我看别人的是冰箱贴/扇子 其中有一个碗挺好看的，祝各位佬中大奖~&lt;/p&gt;
